SQL functions are commonly grouped into these categories:

String Functions – Work with text.
    CONCAT()
    UPPER()
    LOWER()
    LENGTH()
    SUBSTRING()
    TRIM()
    REPLACE()
Aggregate Functions – Operate on multiple rows.
    COUNT()
    SUM()
    AVG()
    MIN()
    MAX()
Numeric Functions – Work with numbers.
    ROUND()
    CEIL()
    FLOOR()
    ABS()
    MOD()
Date and Time Functions
    NOW()
    CURDATE()
    DATE()
    DATEDIFF()
Conversion Functions
    CAST()
    CONVERT()
